    {
      "layer": "governance_institutional",
      "tag": "hohenstaufen_dynastic_base",
      "direction": "rise",
      "description": "Swabia was the territorial base of the Hohenstaufen dynasty, producing two major Holy Roman Emperors (Frederick Barbarossa, Frederick II). The duchy's central European position and agricultural wealth sustained imperial ambitions for 150 years.",
